@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
actor "Giocatore / Admin" as User
participant "React WebApp" as WebApp
participant "API Gateway\n(:8080)" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service\n(:8081)" as Auth
database "PostgreSQL\n(Auth Schema)" as DB

User -> WebApp: Inserisce Email & Password
WebApp -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/auth/login
Gateway -> Auth: Inoltra Login Request

Auth -> DB: Fetch User by Email
alt Credenziali valide
    DB --> Auth: User Entity (Hashed Pass)
    Auth -> Auth: Verifica Hash e genera JWT Token (Stateless)
    Auth --> Gateway: 200 OK + { token: "eyJ..." }
    Gateway --> WebApp: 200 OK + { token }
    WebApp -> WebApp: Salva in sessionStorage
    WebApp -> User: Reindirizza alla Dashboard
else Credenziali invalide
    Auth --> Gateway: 401 Unauthorized
    Gateway --> WebApp: 401 Unauthorized
    WebApp -> User: Mostra errore "Credenziali errate"
end

== API Call Autenticata Successiva ==
User -> WebApp: Clicca su "I miei Tornei"
WebApp -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/tournaments (Header: Authorization: Bearer <token>)
Gateway -> Gateway: Valida firma JWT e analizza ruoli (Gateway Filter)
Gateway -> "Tournament Service": Inoltra GET con headers arricchiti (X-User-Id)
"Tournament Service" --> Gateway: 200 OK [Tornei]
Gateway --> WebApp: 200 OK [Tornei]
WebApp -> User: Renderizza Lista Tornei
@enduml
